How are you?

My name is Melissa Xiao and work for JSW Mold Ltd. Jsw Mold company was established in 1996 and located in Shenzhen of China. We started 
out with very few workers and through the past 13 years of development we have now become a leading mold company in Shenzhen. Equipped with 
40 injection machines from 30 tons to 1200 tons, Hispeed CNC, mirror EDM, double head EDM, advanced wire-cut machine and fitting machine in house.

In 2003, We implemented ISO9001 quality system to guarantee the qualified product and on time delivery. Introduced ISO/TS16949:2002 quality 
management system in 2006.
As a professional injection mold and molding supplier, JSW Mold makes molds for automotive, refrigerators, duplicating machine, washing machine, 
television, produces plastic products, and alarm products,etc. Almost 80% molds and molding parts were exported to overseas.
We currently export products to USA, Europe, Japan and Korea. We have established good partnerships and business relationships with customers 
including IKEA, BENZ, VOLVO, ELECTROLUX,PANASONIC, JUNGWOO, XEROX, OLYMPUS and MINDRAY, etc.

For more information on our products or our company please don't hesitate to contact me and I will send you some pictures of the parts 
we made before. Also, you can visit our website: http://www.jinsunway.com 

